# Daily on hqbox time (UTC); the owner's own time zone is an open ask (owner-facts.md r-3dbb7ed1). Install and revert: see the .service file.
[Unit]
Description=HQ orchestrator answer audit (daily 08:30 UTC)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 08:30:00
Persistent=true
Unit=hq-orchestrator-audit.service

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
